## Results

Holdout: 52 weeks (weeks 104–155), 20 paired seeds (1000–1019), central variant, run once after the freeze. Means with 95% confidence intervals (t-interval over seeds). Capital is shown separately and is never added to annual cost. I125 is the recommended frontier point.

| KPI | P0 Legacy rules | P1 Local optimised | P2 Network | I125 Recommended (P2 + greedy additions) |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Immediate fill rate | {{RESULT:policies.P0.immediate_fill_rate}} {{RESULT:policies.P0.immediate_fill_rate_ci}} | {{RESULT:policies.P1.immediate_fill_rate}} {{RESULT:policies.P1.immediate_fill_rate_ci}} | {{RESULT:policies.P2.immediate_fill_rate}} {{RESULT:policies.P2.immediate_fill_rate_ci}} | {{RESULT:policies.I125.immediate_fill_rate}} {{RESULT:policies.I125.immediate_fill_rate_ci}} |
