## Limitations

The short version: the data is synthetic, the deadline classes are hypothetical (not MEL), grounded aircraft keep accruing flying exposure, the repair shop model is simple, the network is close to single-echelon, the AOG penalty is a scenario value, the optimiser is a greedy heuristic, and every policy (legacy included) leans on an AOG-desk emergency buy that delivers a rotable within 5 days: {{RESULT:frontier.aog_desk.summary}}. The full, specific list is in [LIMITATIONS.md](LIMITATIONS.md).

